    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090940/extras/823de7206788408348e4e0662a48534f.avif?t=1740032902\" width=800 height=671 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy a heartwarming farm life while growing crops and interacting with animals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a port of a title released in 2007 for feature phones in the popular series, which has been developed for numerous hardware platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It simultaneously includes \u201cfor Boy,\u201d in which a boy is the main character, and \u201cfor Girl,\u201d in which a girl is the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy ranch life while cultivating crops, raising cows and sheep on the farm, mining, and growing beautiful flowers in the flower garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While running a ranch, you can deepen your relationship with the people in the village and get married if you get to know them well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favorite partner from the different villagers in the \u201cfor Boy\u201d and \u201cfor Girl\u201d categories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plowing, seeding, watering, fertilizing and harvesting crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Ranch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can raise livestock such as cows, sheep and chickens. You can also get eggs and milk products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell your harvest. You can buy seeds and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a blacksmith where you can cast tools. Above all, in the village you will find your future marriage partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Mine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can excavate gems, ores and power stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Flower Garden</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cultivate flowers and medicinal herbs. Medicinal herbs are valuable as medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I live with my mother. You can check the status.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3090940/extras/823de7206788408348e4e0662a48534f.avif?t=1740032902\" width=800 height=671 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy a heartwarming farm life while growing crops and interacting with animals!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This title is a port of a title released in 2007 for feature phones in the popular series, which has been developed for numerous hardware platforms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It simultaneously includes \u201cfor Boy,\u201d in which a boy is the main character, and \u201cfor Girl,\u201d in which a girl is the main character.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy ranch life while cultivating crops, raising cows and sheep on the farm, mining, and growing beautiful flowers in the flower garden!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While running a ranch, you can deepen your relationship with the people in the village and get married if you get to know them well.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find your favorite partner from the different villagers in the \u201cfor Boy\u201d and \u201cfor Girl\u201d categories!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Farm</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plowing, seeding, watering, fertilizing and harvesting crops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Ranch</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can raise livestock such as cows, sheep and chickens. You can also get eggs and milk products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Village</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can sell your harvest. You can buy seeds and animals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is also a blacksmith where you can cast tools. Above all, in the village you will find your future marriage partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Mine</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can excavate gems, ores and power stones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Flower Garden</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can cultivate flowers and medicinal herbs. Medicinal herbs are valuable as medicine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6Home</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I live with my mother. You can check the status.</p>",
